                                                "sense_id": "17c38650-9f58-3f23-8c8a-ef80bc6b303f",
                                                "text": "One afternoon, as the missionary and I were sitting outside our tents, my attention was attracted towards a group of sepahis engaged under a banyantree, playing the game of backsword […]"
